  "ingredients": [
    "4 (4 ounce) cube steaks",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.33333334326744 cup vegetable oil",
    "2 cups water, or as needed",
    "1 teaspoon beef bouillon granules"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jcFuJjE84EIeGVV-mtERPfRCq5o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/162227_BerdeansCubeSteak_ddmfs_Step1_3x4_3505-86051ebff86d466792e3d71c5a890a03.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/162227/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season cube steaks on both sides with salt and pepper. Place flour in a shallow bowl; press steaks into the flour and shake off any excess.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TWCeAGFPxzF-QzdiGu3wSEGDHcg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/162227_BerdeansCubeSteak_ddmfs_Step2_3x4_3513-450d7d320d3c41b88ef4a4628c269106.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/162227/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add steaks and cook until browned on both sides, about 3 minutes per side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sGVza3BQ1zLvCnrymzM-ocfKDDc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/162227_BerdeansCubeSteak_ddmfs_Step3_3x4_3520-d6037bcc74214fb08ca9e8137b1a6e98.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/162227/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour enough water into the skillet to almost cover steaks.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uDPI8LJ43_DKaxKEaE-IgNE9FXw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/162227_BerdeansCubeSteak_ddmfs_Step4_3x4_3521-73b22fb435714607b18ca6e778fbe415.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/162227/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in beef bouillon and salt; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low, cover, and simmer until very tender, about 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7A8gQdIJQPJPQFy5RpdW83DBrPA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/162227_BerdeansCubeSteak_ddmfs_3x4_3589-415ac26fe8b74b5db5f905470cc509bb.jpg"
